WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A book lies on a dark desk. Warm light finds the gilt edge of its pages.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.583
The book lies open at its title page: Locomotion.

3
00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:22.167
From above, the title page turns to chapter two, One Gallop. A horse and rider are turned one page at a time, faster and faster.

4
00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:31.792
The pages riffle and the horse gallops on the paper.

5
00:00:31.792 --> 00:00:36.583
Close on the corner of the book, the pages flick off the stack.

6
00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:41.375
Chapter three, The Herd. A buffalo appears on the page and starts to run.

7
00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:51.000
The buffalo gallops as the pages riffle.

8
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:58.167
A deer runs along a fence.

9
00:00:58.167 --> 00:01:05.375
A cat at full stretch.

10
00:01:05.375 --> 00:01:09.000
The camera draws back as the riffle slows and stops.

11
00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:18.583
The light lowers. Chapter four, Flight: a white cockatoo beats its wings against a dark grid.

12
00:01:18.583 --> 00:01:28.167
One page, the horse with all four hooves off the ground, comes out of the book and slides onto the desk.

13
00:01:28.167 --> 00:01:38.000
The last page: a colophon with the credits. The light fades.
